      "created_at": "2011-08-25T14:50:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I personally enjoyed it, especially since it is Free to Play. I like the idea of just paying for the extra stuff I want (extra slots, different archtypes, a few costume pieces) rather than the subscription, since as soon as a the subscription ends and you don’t want to renew it you lose everything. But when you pay for the stuff it will be yours forever. I’ve considered making Tempest in it, considering my main is the Tempest archtype and it could be one of his alt. costumes, just for gits and shiggles.</p>",
